@lrf=1|aud=GPT-5.6|scope=research
R|research.order|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|at task start run Get-Date -Format o; derive compact task keywords; perform one delegated exploration pass in web, EPUB, and llm-mem order before planning; do not repeat on ordinary turns
R|research.retry-trigger|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|rerun delegated exploration only after two distinct research or downstream validation failures; the second failure is the trigger, not the first; reset the counter after a successful pass
R|research.delegate|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|delegate the exploration phase to the Researcher subagent by setting task tag subagent and loading researcher.md plus RESEARCHER.css and SUBAGENTS.lrf; main agent preserves attention for synthesis and implementation planning
R|research.delegate-model|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|select Researcher model through SUBAGENTS.lrf difficulty routing; routine discovery prefers Codex Terra medium; ambiguity or high-impact research may escalate to Codex Sol high or xhigh; agy requires an explicit current-task user request
R|research.delegate-output|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|require minimal Researcher output sections Facts, Inferences, Unknowns, Sources, Precedents, Constraints, FAILED, ADVICE, and ESCALATE; main agent independently checks citations and separates fact from inference
R|research.delegate-fallback|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|if the initial or two-failure-triggered Researcher run cannot execute, main agent performs the same web, EPUB, and llm-mem sequence directly and records FAILED; never silently skip the triggered gate
R|research.web|*|MUST|RO_PUBLIC|use the grounding search skill search.exe or native web search with date-bounded keywords; prefer current primary sources; record source title, URL, publication date, accessed date, fact, inference, and unknown; if no public source applies record N_A with reason
R|research.epub|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|use rg.exe to locate kavita-fetch-search.exe; search Kavita metadata with search <keywords>; for candidate series run query <series_id> <keywords>; use EPUB hits only as fact-check evidence and record no-hit or unavailable explicitly
R|research.memory|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|search llm-mem.exe for prior cases using compact task keywords with -level 2 -json; distinguish precedent from current fact; record no-hit or unavailable explicitly
R|research.synthesis|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|after all checks present Facts, Inferences, Unknowns, Sources, Precedents, and Constraints before proposing implementation; never treat an inference as a verified fact
R|research.failure|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|if a required search tool fails, report the exact non-secret failure and continue with available sources; do not silently skip the gate or fabricate results
R|research.secrets|*|MUST_NOT|CRED|never print or persist API keys, tokens, passwords, connection strings, private environment values, Kavita configuration, or raw credential-bearing output
